.credentials.access_key_id` | Access key ID | `***`   |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"295":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-41","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#oss-configuration","content":"| Parameter                           | Description       | Example |\n| ----------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------- |\n| `oss.credentials.access_key_secret` | Access key secret | `***`   |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"296":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-42","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-configuration","content":"| Parameter        | Description           | Example         |\n| ---------------- | --------------------- | --------------- |\n| `hdfs.name_node` | HDFS NameNode address | `namenode:9000` |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"297":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-43","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-configuration","content":"| Parameter   | Description   | Example  |\n| ----------- | ------------- | -------- |\n| `hdfs.user` | HDFS username | `hadoop` |","locale":"en","table":"table-2"},"298":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-44","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#hdfs-environment-requirements","content":"Using HDFS functionality requires special compilation and runtime environment configuration:","locale":"en"},"299":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-45","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#compilation-requirements","content":"To enable HDFS functionality, use the special build command with JNI features:","locale":"en"},"300":{"id":"/