ry. For example, execute `sh meta-bench.sh createWrite` to run the create write test.","locale":"en"},"539":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta-23","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/meta#24-supplementary-notes","content":"JVM parameter description: `-Xms256m -Xmx256m` fixes the JVM heap memory to avoid memory fluctuation affecting the test results.","locale":"en"},"540":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta-24","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/meta#24-supplementary-notes","content":"Dependency description: ensure that the `CURVINE_HOME` environment variable is configured correctly and that the corresponding `curvine-hadoop-*shade.jar` dependency exists in the `lib` directory.","locale":"en"},"541":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta-25","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/meta#3-nnbench-test-results","content":"Based on the above environment and parameters, this test executed four metadata operations: `createWrite` (create write), `openRead` (open read), `rename` (rename), and `delete` (delete). Each operation was repeated 3 times, and the average value was taken as the final result to ensure the accuracy of the test data.","locale":"en"},"542":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta-26","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/meta#31-test-result-summary-table","content":"| Test Operation Type          | Average Operations per Second (QPS) |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `createWrite` (create write) | 21192                               |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"543":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta-27","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/meta","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/meta#31-test-result-summary-table","content":"| Test Operation Type    | Average Operations per Second (QPS) |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `openRead` (open read