"},"953":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-34","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#config-sources","content":"| Variable               | Purpose                             |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_MDS_HOSTNAME` | Override the effective MDS hostname |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"954":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-35","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#config-sources","content":"| Variable                  | Purpose                                |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_WORKER_HOSTNAME` | Override the effective Worker hostname |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"955":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-36","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#config-sources","content":"| Variable                  | Purpose                                               |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_CLIENT_HOSTNAME` | Override the client hostname used for locality checks |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"956":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-37","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#config-sources","content":"| Variable                    | Purpose                                          |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `CURVINE_TRANSFER_HOSTNAME` | Override the effective Transfer service hostname |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"957":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-38","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#how-the-config-is-loaded","content":"The load pipeline is:","locale":"en"},"958":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-39","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#how-the-config-is-loaded","content":"Unknown keys are reported as warnings by `validation::warn_unknown_keys`; they are not rejected. A misspelled key silently keeps its default value, so always check the startup warnings.","locale":"en"},"959":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-40","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#how-the-config-is-loaded","content":"`client.master_addrs` may be omitted. If it is empty, Curvine derives it from `journal.journal_addrs` using `master.rpc_port`; if `journal_addrs` is also empty, it uses `master.hostname:master.rpc_port`.","locale":"en"},"960":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-41","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#how-the-config-is-loaded","content":"The standalone Transfer service uses a reduced loader (`ClusterConf::from_transfer`) that validates only the client and transfer sections.","locale":"en"},"961":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-42","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"When `net_interface` is non-empty (for example `\"eth0\"`), Curvine resolves the first IPv4 address of that interface and applies it to the `master`, `mds`, `journal`, `worker`, `client`, and `transfer` hostnames. When it is set, the `CURVINE_*_HOSTNAME` environment variables are ignored.","locale":"en"},"962":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-43","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"`net_interface` only fills in **this node's own** hostname. Cluster membership lists (`journal.journal_addrs` and `client.master_addrs`) must still be written explicitly, and each node's entry must use the exact IPv4 that its interface resolves to. Otherwise the node cannot locate itself in the Raft group, and startup fails with a clear error.","locale":"en"},"963":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-44","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#top-level-layout","content":"The current `ClusterConf` contains these sections:","locale":"en"},"964":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-45","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#top-level-layout","content":"| Section         | Purpose                                                                    |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| top-level flags | `format_master`, `format_worker`, `testing`, `cluster_id`, `net_interface` |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"965":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-46","page_id":"/