ical device and also covers space consumed by other applications on the same disk. Both are enforced at write admission for new blocks and FileLayout rewrite staging copies.","locale":"en"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-213","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#worker","content":"`[worker.spdk_disk]` is only meaningful in server builds that enable SPDK (`build.sh --spdk` or `--spdk-rdma`). It contains `enabled`, `app_name`, `reactor_mask`, `qpair_acquire_timeout`, and a `targets` array (`trtype`, `adrfam`, `traddr`, `trsvcid`, `subnqn`).","locale":"en"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-214","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#client","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning                                |\n| -------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `master_addrs` | `[]`    | Master RPC addresses; derived if empty |","locale":"en","table":"table-7"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-215","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#client","content":"| Field      | Default     | Meaning                                                                     |\n| ---------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | Client hostname; overridden by `net_interface` or `CURVINE_CLIENT_HOSTNAME` |","locale":"en","table":"table-7"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-216","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type"