oth be enabled; startup rejects the combination.","locale":"en"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` supports the VFS pairs `ro`/`rw`, `nodev`/`dev`, `nosuid`/`suid`, `noexec`/`exec`, `noatime`/`atime`, `sync`/`async`, plus `dirsync`, `allow_other`, `default_permissions`, and `big_write`. The legacy libfuse options `auto_unmount`, `allow_root`, and `max_write` are not supported by the direct mount backend.","locale":"en"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-312","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"Duration values accept strings (`\"1s\"`, `\"500ms\"`, `\"1h\"`) or bare integers interpreted as milliseconds. The older `*_ms` keys remain aliases.","locale":"en"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-313","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` is a standalone process (binary `curvine-web`, started with `bin/curvine-web.sh start`). It serves the admin console — overview, file browser, worker list, configuration and monitoring dashboards. It is not started by `curvine-server` and is not part of the local cluster helper script; start it explicitly when you need the UI.","locale":"en"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-314","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| Field      | Default     | Meaning                             |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | Bind hostname for the admin console |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-315","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| Field  | Default | Meaning                        |\n| ------ | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `port` | `9000`  | HTTP port of the admin console |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-316","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port` (`9010`) is a metrics-only listener. Visiting it in a browser returns Prometheus text output, not the admin UI. Use `[web].port` (`9000`) for the UI.","locale":"en"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-317","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"The admin console embeds its own collector and time-series store, so dashboards work without Prometheus. Switch `mode` to `prometheus` or `auto` to query an existing Prometheus server instead.","locale":"en"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                        |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `enabled` | `true`  | Enable the observability stack |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field  | Default   | Meaning                            |\n| ------ | --------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`, `prometheus`, or `auto` |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-320","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ----------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `scrape_interval` | `60s`   | Scrape interval of the built-in collector |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-321","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field            | Default | Meaning                   |\n| ---------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `scrape_timeout` | `3s`    | Per-target scrape timeout |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-322","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                    |\n| ----------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `retention` | `24h`   | In-memory retention window |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-323","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                 |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_scrapes` | `32`    | Concurrent scrape limit |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-324","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_dashboard_queries` | `8`     | Concurrent range queries per dashboard refresh |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-325","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field        | Default  | Meaning                |\n| ------------ | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `max_series` | `100000` | Series cardinality cap |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-326","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                     |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `max_samples_per_series` | `10000` | Samples retained per series |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-327","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"FUSE metrics scraping is opt-in. With `enabled = true` and empty `targets`, the collector scrapes `127.0.0.1:{fuse.web_port}`.","locale":"en"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                       |\n| --------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | Discover and scrape FUSE `/metrics` endpoints |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                             |\n| --------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]`    | `host:port` or full `http://host:port/metrics` URLs |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field | Default | Meaning                                                   |\n| ----- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | empty   | Prometheus base URL, for example `http://prometheus:9090` |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-331","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                           |\n| --------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `query_timeout` | `5s`    | Timeout for Prometheus query APIs |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-332","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fallback_builtin` | `true`  | With `mode = \"auto\"`, fall back to the built-in collector when Prometheus is unhealthy |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `target_cache_ttl` | `30s`   | TTL for caching `/api/v1/targets` responses |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"When `mode = \"prometheus\"`, also add the target labels described in `etc/prometheus-curvine.yml` so the dashboards can attribute metrics to the right role.","locale":"en"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"The S3-compatible gateway is a standalone service (binary `curvine-s3-gateway`, started with `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh start`). It is read by the gateway process only; Master and Worker ignore this section. See S3 Object Storage Gateway for the supported API surface.","locale":"en"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field    | Default        | Meaning                |\n| -------- | -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `listen` | `0.0.0.0:9900` | S3 HTTP listen address |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field    | Default     | Meaning                                                           |\n| -------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `region` | `us-east-1` | Region reported by `GetBucketLocation` and used for SigV4 scoping |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field          | Default             | Meaning                                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `put_temp_dir` | `/tmp/curvine-temp` | Temporary directory for PUT staging (multipart and simple) |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                         | Default   | Meaning                                                                            |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | `1048576` | Size below which a PUT is buffered in memory instead of spilling to `put_temp_dir` |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                   | Default    | Meaning                       |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | `16777216` | Maximum in-memory buffer size |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-341","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                       | Default | Meaning                                                                           |\n| --------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `access_key` / `secret_key` | empty   | Static credentials when the gateway does not use the distributed credential store |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-342","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                     | Default | Meaning                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | `false` | Load credentials from Curvine instead of static keys |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-343","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                  |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `credentials_path` | empty   | Curvine path holding the credential file |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-344","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                         | Default | Meaning                           |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `cache_refresh_interval_secs` | `30`    | Credential cache refresh interval |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-345","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field               | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| ------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `get_chunk_size_mb` | `1.0`   | Read chunk size in MB (`0.5`, `1`, or `2`) |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-346","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field      | Default | Meaning                            |\n| ---------- | ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `web_port` | `9003`  | Gateway health / metrics HTTP port |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-347","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (default `false`) selects where multipart staging lives: `false` keeps upload parts on the gateway host's local filesystem, `true` uses Curvine DFS so several gateway instances can serve the same upload.","locale":"en"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-348","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` is read by the gateway process, not by the Worker. You can set it in the gateway's own config file; it does not require restarting Workers.","locale":"en"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-349","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"The top-level `[log]` section is shared by the Rust client and FUSE. Each service also has its own nested `log` table (`master.log`, `worker.log`, `mds.log`, `transfer.log`) and the CLI has `[cli].log`.","locale":"en"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-350","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field   | Default | Meaning   |\n| ------- | ------- | --------- |\n| `level` | `INFO`  | Log level |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-351","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default  | Meaning                                             |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log_dir` | `stdout` | `stdout`, `stderr`, or a directory for file logging |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-352","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ----------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `file_name` | empty   | Base log file name; empty means `curvine` |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-353","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `max_log_files` | `10`    | Rotated files to keep |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-354","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `max_file_size_mb` | `100`   | Size-based rotation threshold; `0` means no size limit |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-355","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `time_rotation` | empty   | `daily` or `hourly`; empty means no time-based rotation |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-356","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field            | Default | Meaning                    |\n| ---------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `display_thread` | `false` | Include thread name and ID |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-357","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                 |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `display_position` | `true`  | Include source location |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-358","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]`    | Split named log targets into separate files |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-359","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"Rotation only applies when `log_dir` is a directory. With size and time rotation both unset, files rotate by size at 100 MB. If `max_file_size_mb = 0` and no valid `time_rotation` is configured, files rotate daily so they cannot grow without limit.","locale":"en"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-360","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#cli","content":"`CliConf` contains only `log`. The default CLI log level is `warn`, with output to stdout.","locale":"en"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-361","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"`[job]` configures the legacy Master-side job implementation used by clients with `transfer.enabled = false`. Transfer jobs use `[transfer]` for ownership, recovery, and retention.","locale":"en"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-362","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning             |\n| -------------- | ------- | ------------------- |\n| `job_life_ttl` | `24h`   | Job record lifetime |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-363","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                           |\n| ----------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `job_cleanup_ttl` | `10m`   | Cleanup interval for expired jobs |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-364","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                               |\n| -------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `terminal_retention` | `10m`   | How long terminal jobs stay queryable |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-365","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field           | Default  | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | -------- | -------------