":"en","table":"table-15"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-373","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                  | Default | Meaning                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `task_report_interval` | `10s`   | Task progress report interval |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-374","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                         | Default | Meaning                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `worker_max_concurrent_tasks` | `100`   | Maximum concurrent tasks per Worker |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-375","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"`[transfer]` is read by the standalone Transfer service and by clients that submit Load and Export work to it. A Transfer service also needs the normal `[client]` Master addresses. During a staged rollout, keep this section disabled in the Master and Worker configuration and enable it only in the Transfer and selected client configurations.","locale":"en"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-376","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                      