ments-6","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements#officially-supported-linux-distributions","content":"| OS Distribution | Kernel Requirement | Tested Version | Dependencies |\n| --------------- | ------------------ | -------------- | ------------ |\n| **CentOS 8**    | ≥4.18.0            | 8.5            | fuse3-3.9.1  |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements-7","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements#officially-supported-linux-distributions","content":"| OS Distribution   | Kernel Requirement | Tested Version | Dependencies |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ | -------------- | ------------ |\n| **Rocky Linux 9** | ≥5.14.0            | 9.5            | fuse3-3.10.2 |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements-8","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements#officially-supported-linux-distributions","content":"| OS Distribution | Kernel Requirement | Tested Version | Dependencies |\n| --------------- | ------------------ | -------------- | ------------ |\n| **RHEL 9**      | ≥5.14.0            | 9.5            | fuse3-3.10.2 |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements-9","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/system-requirements#officially-supported-linux-distributions","content":"| OS Distribution | Kernel Requirement | Tested Version | Dependencies |\n| --------------- | ------------------ | -------------- | ------------ |\n| **Ubuntu 22**   | ≥5.15.0            | 22.4           | fuse3-3.10.5 |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/Overview/architecture","page_id":"/docs/Overview/architecture","type":"page","content":"Technical Architecture","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Overvie