I-Driver/Setup-77","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup#curvine-volume-parameters","content":"| Parameter   | Required | Default     | Description                        |\n| ----------- | -------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `path-type` | No       | `Directory` | `Directory` or `DirectoryOrCreate` |","locale":"en","table":"table-7"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup-78","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup#curvine-volume-parameters","content":"Every other key is forwarded to `curvine-fuse` as a CLI flag, for example\n`io-threads=4` or `worker-threads=8`. Three groups are not forwarded:","locale":"en"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup-79","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup#curvine-volume-parameters","content":"`csi.storage.k8s.io/*` keys are CSI-internal and dropped.","locale":"en"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup-80","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup#curvine-volume-parameters","content":"`mnt-path` is rejected at provision time; the driver computes the host mount\npath itself (`/var/lib/kubelet/plugins/kubernetes.io/csi/curvine/<mount-key>/fuse-mount`).","locale":"en"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup-81","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup#curvine-volume-parameters","content":"`curvine-path`, `author`, and `volume-handle` are owned by the controller and\nwritten into the PV `volumeAttributes`; do not set them on a StorageClass.","locale":"en"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Setup-82","page_id":"/docs/User-Manu