","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                              | Description         |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| `cv fs mkdir <PATH> [-p\\|--parents]` | Create a directory. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2984":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-68","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                                   | Description                                                           |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs put <LOCAL_PATH> <REMOTE_PATH> [-n\\|--no-clobber]` | Upload a local file into Curvine; `-n` keeps an existing destination. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2985":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-69","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                         | Description                            |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs get <PATH> <LOCAL_PATH>` | Download a Curvine file to local disk. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2986":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-70","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                      | Description                                   |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs cat <PATH> [--offset N] [--length N]` | Print file contents, optionally a byte range. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2987":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                             | Description                                      |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs tail <PATH> [-n\\|--bytes N]` | Print the last bytes of a file, 1024 by default. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2988":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command              | Description                                |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs touch <PATH>` | Create an empty file or update timestamps. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2989":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-73","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                                                    | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs rm <PATH> [-r\\|--recursive] [--skip-trash] [--async] [-f\\|--force]` | Remove a file or directory. `--skip-trash` deletes permanently, bypassing the recycle bin if it is enabled; `--async` returns immediately and lets the Master reclaim the entry in the background (Curvine paths only); `-f` ignores a path that does not exist. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2990":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-74","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command          | Description                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs trash ls` | List the entries in the recycle bin. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2991":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-75","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                                         | Description                                                                                             |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs trash restore <TRASH_PATH> [--dst <PATH>] [--overwrite]` | Restore a recycle-bin entry such as `/.Trash/1700000000000-42` to its original location, or to `--dst`. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2992":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                      | Description                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs trash empty [--wait]` | Permanently delete every entry in the recycle bin; `--wait` waits until the Master has reclaimed them and prints the reclaimed size. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2993":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                      | Description                                                |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs stat <PATH> [--json]` | Show file or directory status; `--json` prints it as JSON. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2994":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command              | Description                             |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs count <PATH>` | Count files / directories under a path. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2995":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                          | Description     |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `cv fs mv <SRC_PATH> <DST_PATH>` | Move or rename. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2996":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-80","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                     | Description                 |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `cv fs du <PATH> [-h] [-v]` | Show directory space usage. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2997":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-81","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command         | Description                             |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs df [-h]` | Show capacity / used / available space. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-82","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                   | Description         |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cv fs chmod <MODE> <PATH> [--recursive]` | Change permissions. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2999":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-83","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                          | Description           |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `cv fs chown <OWNER:GROUP> <PATH> [--recursive]` | Change owner / group. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"3000":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-84","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                      | Description                       |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs blocks <PATH> [--format table\\|json]` | Show file block location details. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"3001":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-85","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                               | Description                              