":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#dataload-job-启动后失败","content":"DataLoad Job 启动后失败","locale":"zh-cn"},"3627":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","content":"Fluid 可以把 Kubernetes 里的 `Dataset` 暴露给业务 Pod。Curvine 可以作为这个 Dataset 背后的缓存运行时，也可以作为一个已经存在的存储集群，由 Fluid 负责挂载到业务 Pod。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3628":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","content":"如果是新接入 Fluid，建议优先使用 **CacheRuntime**。它会让 Fluid 拉起 Curvine master、worker 和 FUSE client Pod，也是支持 `DataLoad` 数据预热的主要方式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3629":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式           | 适用场景                                      | Fluid 会启动什么                            | 主要资源                                         |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| CacheRuntime | 希望 Fluid 在 Kubernetes 中管理一套 Curvine 缓存集群。 | Curvine master、worker、client/FUSE Pod。 | `CacheRuntimeClass`、`Dataset`、`CacheRuntime` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3630":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式          | 适用场景                                   | Fluid 会启动什么               | 主要资源                                         |\n| ----------- | -----------------------