":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                   | 用途                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/entrypoint.sh` | Fluid 入口脚本，会作为 `/fluid-entrypoint.sh` 打进主镜像，并判断 CacheRuntime / ThinRuntime 模式。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3636":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                        | 用途                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/generate_config.py` | 解析 Fluid runtime JSON，为 CacheRuntime Pod 生成 Curvine TOML 配置。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3637":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                     | 用途                                                           |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/config-parse.py` | 解析 Fluid runtime JSON，为 ThinRuntime 生成 Curvine TOML 配置和挂载脚本。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3638":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                 | 用途                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------