gging-guide-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide#日志配置","content":"示例配置中的默认值如下。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4290":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide#cli","content":"当 `log_dir = \"stdout\"` 且组件通过包装脚本启动时，结构化日志最终会进入对应的 `logs/*.out` 文件，因为包装脚本把 stdout 重定向到了这些文件。若将 `log_dir` 改成目录路径，则需要直接查看该目录下的日志文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4291":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide#cli","content":"调试时建议将相关组件的日志级别提升到 `debug` 或 `trace`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4292":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide#启动命令","content":"| 组件     | 包装脚本命令                        | 实际二进制                                                           |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Master | `bin/curvine-master.sh start` | `lib/curvine-server --service master --conf $CURVINE_CONF_FILE` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4293":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide#启动命令","content":"| 组件     | 包装脚本命令                        | 实际二进制                                                           |\n| ------ | ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Worker | `bin/curvine-worker.sh start` | `lib/curvine-server --service worker --conf $CURVINE_CONF_FILE` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4294":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugging-guide-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/debugg