/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#当前仓库可见的贡献方向","content":"| 方向       | 当前仓库位置         |\n| -------- | -------------- |\n| Web 与管理面 | `curvine-web/` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4427":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#当前仓库可见的贡献方向","content":"| 方向         | 当前仓库位置                                                     |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 测试、压测与回归工具 | `curvine-tests/`、`build/tests/`、`curvine-tests/benchmark/` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4428":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#当前仓库可见的贡献方向","content":"| 方向               | 当前仓库位置                           |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Kubernetes 与打包资源 | `curvine-csi/`、`curvine-docker/` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4429":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#对贡献者的规划建议","content":"以当前仓库目录、构建脚本和测试覆盖面为准，而不是沿用过时的里程碑表。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4430":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#对贡献者的规划建议","content":"顶层目录只能说明当前存在相关工作面，不代表具体发布日期承诺。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4431":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#对贡献者的规划建议","content":"对于参考仓库中没有明确落地的存储或协议能力，不要在文档里继续扩写未发布承诺。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4432":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"如果已有对应任务，直接在 GitHub Issues 中参与讨论。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4433":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"如果是更宽泛的方向建议，优先在 GitHub Discussions 中提出。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4434":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"更新文档时，确保命令、构建产物和功能描述都与参考仓库当前实际可见的状态一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4435":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"page","content":"技能指南","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Contributor Guide"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","locale":"zh-cn"},"4436":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#skill-是什么不是什么","content":"Skill 是什么，不是什么","locale":"zh-cn"},"4437":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"开始之前","locale":"zh-cn"},"4438":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#四个常用工作流","content":"四个常用工作流","locale":"zh-cn"},"4439":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#1-用-cv-create-issue-创建-issue","content":"1. 用 `cv-create-issue` 创建 Issue","locale":"zh-cn"},"4440":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"2. 用 `cv-handle-issue` 解决 Issue","locale":"zh-cn"},"4441":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"3. 用 `cv-create-pr` 提交 PR","locale":"zh-cn"},"4442":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"4. Review 代码","locale":"zh-cn"},"4443":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"配套技能","locale":"zh-cn"},"4444":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"串起来看一遍","locale":"zh-cn"},"4445":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"几条基本规则","locale":"zh-cn"},"4446":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"延伸阅读","locale":"zh-cn"},"4447":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","content":"每个项目都有自己的做事习惯：Issue 该套哪个模板、PR 标题怎么写、Review 时先看什么。Curvine 把这些习惯整理成了 **skill**（技能）——一份份简短、易读的操作手册，AI 编程助手可以直接照着做。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4448":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","content":"所有 skill 都放在 Curvine 仓库的 `.agents/skills/` 目录下。每个 skill 就是一个文件夹，里面有一个 `SKILL.md`。不需要安装服务，也不需要注册账号；skill 和代码一起做版本管理，会随着项目一起演进。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4449":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","content":"你可以把 skill 当成检查清单，自己按步骤完成；也可以交给 AI 助手，让它带你走完流程。本文重点介绍第二种方式，并围绕开发者最常做的四件事展开：创建 Issue、解决 Issue、提交 PR、Review 代码。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4450":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#skill-是什么不是什么","content":"Skill 是指导，不是自动化。它告诉 AI 助手 Curvine 希望这件事怎么做、该运行哪些命令。它不会替你合并代码，不会绕过 CI，也不会替你做决定。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4451":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#skill-是什么不是什么","content":"最后一点很重要。按照设计，skill 在任何内容离开你的电脑之前都会停下来：先起草 Issue、提交信息、PR 描述或 Review 评论，等你确认后再执行。发布什么、提交什么，始终由你决定。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4452":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"你需要准备：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4453":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"一份 `curvine` 仓库的本地克隆。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4454":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"一个能加载项目 skill 的 AI 编程助手。Claude Code、Cursor、Codex 和 GitHub Copilot 目前都可以。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4455":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"已登录的 GitHub CLI，因为有些 skill 会创建 Issue、推送分支或发布 Review 评论。可以用 `gh auth status` 检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4456":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"如果要改 Rust 代码，还需要可用的构建环境，具体见开发指南。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4457":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"Skill 会通过 AI 助手本来就会读取的目录自动加载：`.claude/skills`、`.cursor/skills` 和 `.github/skills` 都是指向 `.agents/skills` 的软链接，Codex 则直接读取 `.agents/skills`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4458":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"如果你的助手支持斜杠命令，直接按名字调用即可：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4459":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#开始之前","content":"Cursor 会自动发现这些 skill，不需要斜杠命令。如果你不确定某个 skill 具体做什么，打开它的 `SKILL.md` 看看——那份文件就是它的约定。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4460":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#1-用-cv-create-issue-创建-issue","content":"当你发现 Bug，或者想提出一个新功能时，可以用它。提示词可以很短：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4461":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#1-用-cv-create-issue-创建-issue","content":"Skill 会先搜索现有的 Issue，避免重复，然后从 `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/` 中选择合适的模板并起草正文。Bug 报告需要复现步骤和环境信息；功能请求还会多出三个部分：**Goal**、**Not Goal** 和 **Test Plan**，让范围在写代码之前就对齐。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4462":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#1-用-cv-create-issue-创建-issue","content":"你检查草稿、调整措辞并确认后，Issue 才会带着对应标签创建出来。如果它是某个大 Issue 的子任务，skill 会在标题前加 `[SUB]`，并在正文里链接 `Parent: #<number>`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4463":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#1-用-cv-create-issue-创建-issue","content":"一个小建议：把真实的日志、版本号和复现步骤贴进去。一个清晰的 Issue，是送给后来修复它的人的一份礼物——很多时候那个人就是未来的你。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4464":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"把 Issue 编号或链接交给它：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4465":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"这个流程的前半段是思考，不是敲代码。Skill 会阅读 Issue，整理问题、涉及的模块、风险和测试策略，然后提出一份计划。**在你确认计划之前，它不会写任何代码。** 改计划成本很低，改代码则不然。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4466":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"确认之后，skill 会创建以 Issue 命名的分支（`fix/123-short-slug` 或 `feat/123-short-slug`），实现约定范围内的改动，补充测试，运行 `make format`，最后交给 `cv-create-pr`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4467":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"如果改动预计超过大约 500 行，skill 会转交给 `cv-tasks-breakdown`。后者会把工作拆成有依赖顺序的小任务，每个任务小到可以单独作为一次提交，并可以创建 `[SUB]` 子 Issue 来跟踪。小步前进，始终保持构建和测试通过。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4468":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#2-用-cv-handle-issue-解决-issue","content":"看计划的时候，不妨先代入 Reviewer 的视角。如果觉得范围不对，现在提出来最划算。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4469":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"提交准备好之后，运行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4470":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"Skill 会运行 `make format`、检查 diff，然后起草 PR：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4471":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"**标题：** `<type>(<module>): <description> (#<issueNumber>)`","locale":"zh-cn"},"4472":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"**正文：** Summary、Issue Describe / Design、Changes、Test verified、Dependencies","locale":"zh-cn"},"4473":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"请花一点时间认真填写 **Test verified** 表格，写下你实际运行过的测试。CI 全绿是好消息，但它和“我跑了这些用例，结果如下”不是一回事，Reviewer 能看出区别。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4474":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#3-用-cv-create-pr-提交-pr","content":"PR 默认以草稿（draft）形式创建。描述确认无误、测试通过后，再标记为可 Review。范围聚焦、描述清楚的 PR，Review 得更快，万一出问题也更容易回滚。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4475":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"这里有两个 skill，分别对应 Review 的双方。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4476":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"**如果你是 Reviewer**，运行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4477":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"Skill 会核对 PR 当前的 base 和 head，先读改动的测试、再读实现，并梳理这次改动涉及哪些 crate。然后它会检查正确性、并发与生命周期、接口兼容性，以及数据、RPC 和元数据路径上的性能影响。评论会带上明确的级别前缀——`Critical:`、`Required:` 或 `Optional:`——并给出本地结论。在你确认之前，不会发布任何内容。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4478":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"**如果你是作者，需要回应 Review 意见**，运行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4479":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"Skill 会收集所有 Review 评论，整理成一张表，列出建议接受、部分接受和拒绝的意见及理由。你确认这张表后，skill 才会应用修改、推送代码、用英文逐条回复，并标记已解决的讨论。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4480":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#4-review-代码","content":"Review 是一场讨论，不是打分。如果你不同意某条意见，把理由说清楚——这些理由会被记录下来，方便后来的人理解当时的决定。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4481":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"上面四个是主干流程，下面这些是在路不好走时帮你绕过去的“辅路”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4482":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill          | 适用场景                                                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv-codegraph` | 在本地建立符号和调用路径索引，让 AI 助手不用扫全仓库就能回答“这段逻辑在哪里”。一次性安装步骤见该 skill 本身。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4483":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill                | 适用场景                                           |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv-tasks-breakdown` | 把大型功能拆成有依赖顺序的小任务，每个任务作为一次提交并自带测试，也可以创建子 Issue。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4484":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill         | 适用场景                                         |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv-csi-test` | 指导在 Kubernetes 上部署和测试 CSI 驱动，包括重启、恢复和卷扩容等场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4485":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill             | 适用场景                                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `cv-run-workflow` | 用正确的分支和参数触发 GitHub Actions，并跟踪运行结果、定位失败。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4486":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill            | 适用场景                        |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `cv-test-report` | 把全链路测试结果整理成标准格式，并发布到测试报告站点。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4487":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#配套技能","content":"| Skill           | 适用场景                                            |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv-add-skills` | 说明如何新增或修改 `cv-*` skill，并同步维护 `AGENTS.md` 中的注册表。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4488":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"一次典型的贡献，在有 skill 参与时大概是这样：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4489":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"你发现一个 Bug，运行 `/cv-create-issue`。简单检查后，Issue `#123` 创建完成。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4490":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"你运行 `/cv-handle-issue 123`。AI 提出计划，你调整并确认；它创建分支、编写修复和测试，并运行 `make format`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4491":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"你运行 `/cv-create-pr`，得到一个描述完整、测试记录清楚的草稿 PR。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4492":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"Maintainer 运行 `/cv-submit-pr-review 124`。在 TA 确认草稿评论后，Review 才会发布。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4493":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"你运行 `/cv-address-pr-review 124`：接受两条意见，拒绝一条并说明理由。修改被推送，讨论被标记为解决。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4494":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"CI 通过，PR 合并。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4495":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#串起来看一遍","content":"每一步的决定都由人做出。AI 负责的是那些重复的部分：找模板、排版标题、记住 PR 正文需要哪些章节、跟踪每一条 Review 意见。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4496":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"**改动由你负责。** Skill 只是助手。每个 diff 都要自己看，测试要自己跑，并且能够解释这次改动。提交记录上是你的名字。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4497":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"**确认之前先看一眼。** 草稿的存在是有原因的。Issue、PR 正文或 Review 评论，确认前都值得检查一遍。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4498":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"**GitHub 上统一用英文。** Issue、PR、Review 评论以及 skill 本身都用英文书写，方便社区里的每个人跟进。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4499":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"**CI 说了算。** 格式化、编译、测试和 PR 标题检查仍然决定一个改动能否合入，skill 不会绕过它们。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4500":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#几条基本规则","content":"**Skill 和代码一起维护。** 想改进某个 skill，请遵循 `cv-add-skills`，并同步更新 `AGENTS.md` 中的注册表。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4501":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"Curvine 贡献指南","locale":"zh-cn"},"4502":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"`.agents` 目录说明","locale":"zh-cn"},"4503":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"共享工作流规则","locale":"zh-cn"},"4504":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"全部 `cv-*` skill","locale":"zh-cn"},"4505":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/skills-guide#延伸阅读","content":"如果只能记住一句话，那就是：skill 用来减少琐事，而不是替代你的判断。使用它、质疑它、改进它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4506":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"page","content":"裸机部署","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","部署集群","分布式模式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","locale":"zh-cn"},"4507":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"逻辑部署架构","locale":"zh-cn"},"4508":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#启动命令","content":"启动命令","locale":"zh-cn"},"4509":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","content":"部署前需要创建安装包与修改配置文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4510":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"下图是 Curvine 裸机部署的逻辑架构。**集群核心**仅由 Master 与 Worker 进程组成，二者启动后集群即可对外服务。FUSE 是**可选的**访问方式，**不参与**集群启动——仅在应用需要 POSIX 挂载点时再启用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4511":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**集群核心（必选）：** 在规划的主机上启动 `curvine-master` 与 `curvine-worker`。二者就绪后集群即可工作，可通过 CLI（`cv`）或 SDK 访问，**无需先启动 FUSE**。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4512":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**FUSE（可选）：** 仅当需要 POSIX 文件系统挂载（如兼容旧工具、脚本）时再启动 `curvine-fuse`。FUSE 不是核心服务，集群的启动与运行不依赖它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4513":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"如需让 Load 和 Export 使用独立调度，应在集群健康后部署独立的可选 Transfer 服务。\n它不加入 Master Raft 组，也不要求修改 Master 或 Worker 配置。参见\n物理机部署 Transfer。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4514":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**FUSE 不参与集群启动。** Curvine 集群由 Master 与 Worker 组成。FUSE 与 CLI、SDK 一样，只是多种访问方式之一，仅在应用需要本地挂载点时才有必要启用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4515":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"每台 Worker 需要有自己确定的 IP。多网卡环境下，建议通过环境变量显式指定 IP，避免自动取到预期外的网卡地址。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4516":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#启动命令","content":"裸机部署需手动启动**集群核心**（master 与 worker）；仅在需要 POSIX 挂载的节点上**按需**启动 FUSE：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4517":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"page","content":"配置参考","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","部署集群","分布式模式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","locale":"zh-cn"},"4518":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"配置来源","locale":"zh-cn"},"4519":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"配置加载流程","locale":"zh-cn"},"4520":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvi