r/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` 支持 VFS 选项对 `ro`/`rw`、`nodev`/`dev`、`nosuid`/`suid`、`noexec`/`exec`、`noatime`/`atime`、`sync`/`async`，以及 `dirsync`、`allow_other`、`default_permissions`、`big_write`。旧版 libfuse 选项 `auto_unmount`、`allow_root`、`max_write` 不受直接挂载后端支持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4829":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"时长值支持字符串（`\"1s\"`、`\"500ms\"`、`\"1h\"`）或按毫秒解释的裸整数。旧的 `*_ms` 键仍作为别名接受。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4830":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-312","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` 是一个独立进程（二进制 `curvine-web`，通过 `bin/curvine-web.sh start` 启动），提供管理控制台：集群总览、文件浏览、Worker 列表、配置与监控大盘。它不由 `curvine-server` 启动，也不在本地集群辅助脚本的启动列表中；需要 UI 时请单独启动。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4831":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-313","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段         | 默认值         | 含义         |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | 管理控制台监听主机名 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4832":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-314","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段     | 默认值    | 含义            |\n| ------ | ------ | ------------- |\n| `port` | `9000` | 管理控制台 HTTP 端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4833":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-315","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port`（`9010`）只是一个指标监听端口，用浏览器打开它只会得到 Prometheus 文本输出，不是管理界面。UI 请访问 `[web].port`（`9000`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4834":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-316","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"管理控制台内嵌了自己的采集器和时序库，因此不依赖 Prometheus 也能看大盘。把 `mode` 改成 `prometheus` 或 `auto` 可改为查询已有的 Prometheus。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4835":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-317","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段        | 默认值    | 含义         |\n| --------- | ------ | ---------- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | 是否启用可观测性组件 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4836":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段     | 默认值       | 含义                              |\n| ------ | --------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`、`prometheus` 或 `auto` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4837":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine