s` | `8` | 单次大盘刷新的并发范围查询上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4842":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-324","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段           | 默认值      | 含义     |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------ |\n| `max_series` | `100000` | 序列基数上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4843":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-325","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                       | 默认值     | 含义         |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ---------- |\n| `max_samples_per_series` | `10000` | 每个序列保留的样本数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4844":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-326","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"FUSE 指标抓取默认关闭。`enabled = true` 且 `targets` 为空时，采集器会抓取 `127.0.0.1:{fuse.web_port}`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4845":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-327","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值     | 含义                         |\n| --------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | 是否发现并抓取 FUSE `/metrics` 端点 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4846":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值  | 含义                                             |\n| --------- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]` | `host:port` 或完整的 `http://host:port/metrics` 地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4847":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段    | 默认值 | 含义                                          |\n| ----- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | 空   | Prometheus 基础地址，例如 `http://prometheus:9090` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4848":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段              | 默认值  | 含义                   |\n| --------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| `query_timeout` | `5s` | Prometheus 查询 API 超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4849":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-331","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值    | 含义                                        |\n| ------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `fallback_builtin` | `true` | `mode = \"auto\"` 时，Prometheus 不可用则回退到内置采集器 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4850":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-332","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值   | 含义                        |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ------------------------- |\n| `target_cache_ttl` | `30s` | `/api/v1/targets` 响应的缓存时长 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4851":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"当 `mode = \"prometheus\"` 时，还需要按 `etc/prometheus-curvine.yml` 中的说明加上目标标签，大盘才能把指标归属到正确的角色。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4852":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"S3 兼容网关是一个独立服务（二进制 `curvine-s3-gateway`，通过 `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh start` 启动）。本段只被网关进程读取，Master 和 Worker 会忽略它。支持的 API 范围见 S3 对象存储网关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4853":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段       | 默认值            | 含义           |\n| -------- | -------------- | ------------ |\n| `listen` | `0.0.0.0:9900` | S3 HTTP 监听地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4854":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段       | 默认值         | 含义                                       |\n| -------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `region` | `us-east-1` | `GetBucketLocation` 返回的区域，也用于 SigV4 签名范围 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4855":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段             | 默认值                 | 含义                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `put_temp_dir` | `/tmp/curvine-temp` | PUT 暂存目录（分片和普通上传共用） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4856":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                            | 默认值       | 含义                                  |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | `1048576` | 低于该大小的 PUT 在内存中缓冲，不落 `put_temp_dir` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4857":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                      | 默认值        | 含义     |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- | ------ |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | `16777216` | 内存缓冲上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4858":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"t