ributed-Mode/conf#fault_injection","content":"故障 HTTP 路由要求二进制使用 `fault-injection` Cargo feature 构建（例如 `curvine-server/fault-injection`）。如果启用了 `[fault_injection]` 但构建时未包含该 feature，服务启动会直接失败，而不是静默省略路由。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4927":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-409","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#版本兼容策略","content":"`[master.compatibility]` 与 `[worker.compatibility]` 字段相同：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4928":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-410","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#版本兼容策略","content":"| 字段     | 默认值        | 含义                                      |\n| ------ | ---------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `diagnose` | `diagnose` 只记录不兼容；`enforce` 拒绝不兼容的 peer |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-19"},"4929":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-411","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#版本兼容策略","content":"| 字段                   | 默认值 | 含义                             |\n| -------------------- | --- | ------------------------------ |\n| `min_worker_version` | 空   | Master 接受的最低 Worker 版本（空表示不限制） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-19"},"4930":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-412","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#版本兼容策略","content":"| 字段                   | 默认值 | 含义                 |\n| -------------------- | --- | ------------------ |\n| `min_client_version` | 空   | 接受的最低