-Manuals/Access/fuse-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"**默认挂载路径**：`/curvine-fuse`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5755":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"**默认配置**：`conf/curvine-cluster.toml`（相对于启动进程时的当前工作目录）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5756":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"使用 `bin/curvine-fuse.sh stop` 停止，`bin/curvine-fuse.sh restart` 重启。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5757":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#使用挂载点","content":"在 FUSE 挂载路径下可使用常规 Linux 文件命令：`ls`、`cat`、`rm`、`mv`、`mkdir`、`du`、`cp` 等。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5758":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#使用挂载点","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5759":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#使用挂载点","content":"此处写入的数据会落在 Curvine 集群中；也可访问对应 已挂载 UFS 的路径（统一文件系统视图）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5760":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#可选参数","content":"启动 FUSE 时可传入底层 `curvine-fuse` 的选项，例如：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5761":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#可选参数","content":"| 选项           | 说明    | 默认值             |\n| ------------ 