,"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#概述","content":"S3 请求进入网关后，先通过凭据存储完成认证，再经由 Curvine 客户端执行。对象数据以流式方式在网关与 Curvine Worker 之间传输，不会将整个对象缓存在内存中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5828":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"S3 兼容的 bucket 和对象 API（见 支持的 S3 操作）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5829":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"使用 AWS Signature V2/V4 认证，支持本地或 Curvine 托管的凭据存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"5830":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持 HTTP Range 请求，返回 `206 Partial Content`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5831":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持大对象分片上传","locale":"zh-cn"},"5832":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"流式读写","locale":"zh-cn"},"5833":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持独立部署，并可通过负载均衡横向扩展","locale":"zh-cn"},"5834":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#架构说明","content":"S3 网关是 S3 API 客户端的前端，负责将 S3 请求转换为 Curvine 文件系统操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5835":{"id":"/zh-c