e_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"仅当配置的凭据存储为空时，网关才会导入环境变量中的凭据；导入的密钥对会写入本地凭据存储。如果既没有已存储的凭据，也没有环境变量凭据，网关将以空存储启动，并拒绝所有请求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5891":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令","content":"`credential list --show-secrets` 和 `credential generate` 会将 secret key 打印到终端。请将该输出视为敏感信息，避免写入 shell 历史或共享日志。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5892":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#使用示例","content":"以下示例使用 `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 和 `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`。请先导出在 快速开始 中创建的密钥对：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5893":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#range-请求","content":"Range 响应使用状态码 `206`，并包含 `Content-Range` 头。签名请求最简单的生成方式是使用 S3 SDK 或 AWS CLI。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5894":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#分片上传-1","content":"`AbortMultipartUpload` 尚未路由，因此放弃的上传会在临时存储目录中留下分片，需要手动清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5895":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#单实例","content":"请通过进程管理工具（systemd、supervisor、Kubernetes）运行该二进制。目前尚未提供 start/stop 脚本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5896":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"除临时分片数据和凭据外，网关是无状态的，因此可以部署在负载均衡之后：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5897":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"当网关实例多于一个时，请启用分布式分片存储和分布式凭据，使任意实例都能完成上传：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5898":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"如果未启用分布式存储，分片会保留在接收该分片的实例本地 `put_temp_dir` 中；路由到其他实例的 `CompleteMultipartUpload` 将找不到这些分片。另一种方式是在负载均衡上配置会话保持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5899":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"网关通过 `tracing` 将日志输出到 stdout。可以使用 `RUST_LOG` 调整日志级别：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5900":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"日志覆盖请求处理、认证失败、分片操作和文件系统错误。目前没有 metrics 端点；请使用 `/healthz` 端点进行存活检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5901":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-115","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `CopyObject`；客户端需要先下载再重新上传。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5902":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-116","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `AbortMultipartUpload`；放弃的上传会遗留临时分片。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5903":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-117","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"`ListObjectsV2` 只返回单页：`continuation-token` 和 `max-keys` 会被忽略，`is-truncated` 始终为 `false`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5904":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-118","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"接受条件请求头（`If-Match`、`If-None-Match`），但不会对其进行判断。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5905":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-119","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"启用 Curvine 回收站时，`DeleteObject` 和 `DeleteBucket` 会将数据移入回收站，而不是永久删除。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5906":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-120","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#端口被占用","content":"修改 `[s3_gateway]` 中的监听地址，或传入不同的 `--listen` 值：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5907":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-121","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#配置文件错误","content":"如果配置文件无法加载，网关会打印警告并继续使用默认配置。请检查路径和 TOML 语法：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5908":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-122","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#bucket-不存在","content":"上传前请先创建 bucket（`aws s3 mb`），网关不会隐式创建 bucket。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5909":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-123","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#性能调优","content":"对于大对象场景，可以提高 `get_chunk_size_mb`，并确保 `put_temp_dir` 位于快速本地存储上。当 `worker.enable_s3_gateway = true` 时，分片会直接写入 Curvine，不会使用 `put_temp_dir`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5910":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"page","content":"SDK 访问","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","接入方式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","locale":"zh-cn"},"5911":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-cn"},"5912":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"Rust SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5913":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"Java SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5914":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"Hadoop FileSystem","locale":"zh-cn"},"5915":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-api","content":"Java API","locale":"zh-cn"},"5916":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5917":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"通用配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"5918":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","content":"Curvine 提供多语言 SDK，使应用可通过 RPC 访问 Curvine 文件系统（元数据访问 Master，块数据访问 Worker），而无需使用 FUSE。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5919":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                              | 适用场景             |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Rust** | `curvine-client` / `curvine-libsdk` | 原生 Rust 应用、高性能场景 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5920":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                                                                                              | 适用场景                        |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Java** | `io.curvine.CurvineFileSystem`（Hadoop `FileSystem`，scheme 为 `cv://`），以及 `curvine-libsdk` 的 Java SDK | Hadoop/Spark/Flink 等 JVM 应用 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5921":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK        | 包 / 模块                                                          | 适用场景                      |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Python** | `curvinefs` —— `CurvineClient`（原生）与 `CurvineFileSystem`（fsspec） | 机器学习、数据流水线、pandas/dask、脚本 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5922":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"所有 SDK 均需在 Curvine 集群（Master 与 Worker）已启动、且客户端配置正确（如 `curvine-cluster.toml` 中的 `master_addrs`）的前提下使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5923":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"通过 `curvine-client`（或 `curvine-libsdk` 暴露的 Rust API）编程式创建文件、读写数据、列举目录。配置通常从 `curvine-cluster.toml` 或环境变量加载。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5924":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"构建与用法参见 开发指南 及 Curvine 源码仓库（如 `curvine-client`、`curvine-libsdk` 及 `curvine-tests` 下的集成测试）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5925":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"Hadoop 路径使用的 URI scheme 是 **`cv://`**（不是 `fs.cv://`），实现类是 `io.curvine.CurvineFileSystem`，因此 `FileSystem.get(URI.create(\"cv://default/path\"), conf)` 会返回 Curvine 客户端。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5926":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"`FilesystemConf` 的每个字段都按 `fs.cv.<字段名>` 读取——是 `fs.cv.master_addrs`，不是 `fs.cv.default.master_addrs`。`curvine-cluster.toml` 中 `[client]` 下的配置都可以用这种方式覆盖，且 `-D` 系统属性优先级高于配置文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5927":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"可选键：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5928":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                        | 默认值     | 含义                            |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `fs.cv.transfer.enabled` | `false` | 将 load/export 路由到 Transfer 服务 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5929":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                          | 默认值 | 含义              |\n| -------------------------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `fs.cv.transfer.endpoints` | —   | Transfer RPC 地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5930":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 含义                        |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------- |\n| `fs.cv.proxy.enabled` | `true` | 启用基于 ZooKeeper 的 proxy 开关 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5931":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 含义                  |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------- |\n| `fs.cv.proxy.zk.server` | 空   | 该开关使用的 ZooKeeper 地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5932":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                     | 默认值                      | 含义            |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------- |\n| `fs.cv.proxy.zk.path` | `/curvine/proxy_enabled` | 存放开关状态的 znode |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5933":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#hadoop-filesystem","content":"| 键                     | 默认值   | 含义         |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ---------- |\n| `fs.cv.proxy.timeout` | `60s` | proxy 查询超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"5934":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-23","page_id"