ineFileSystem`**——fsspec 实现，注册为 `curvinefs` spec，因此 pandas、dask 等支持 fsspec 的库可以直接读取集群：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5941":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"在源码树中安装：`pip install ./curvine-libsdk/python`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5942":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**Master 地址**：在集群配置（如 `curvine-cluster.toml`）中设置 `client.master_addrs`，或在各 SDK 中传入等价配置（如 Java 的 `fs.cv.master_addrs`）。格式：`host1:8995,host2:8995`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5943":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**配置文件**：多数 SDK 支持传入配置文件路径（如 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`），与 CLI（`cv`）、FUSE 共用同一配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5944":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"若需 UFS（统一文件系统）访问，请先用 `cv mount` 挂载 UFS 路径；随后在对应 Curvine 路径上的 SDK 操作语义与 数据编排 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5945":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"page","content":"在 Deployment 中使用动态 PVC","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","K8S CSI 驱动"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","locale":"zh-cn"},"5946":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#示例拓扑","content":"示例拓扑","locale":"zh-cn"},"5947":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"hea