res/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"7.3 过期策略说明","locale":"zh-cn"},"6225":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#74-使用注意mtime-与数据拷贝","content":"7.4 使用注意：mtime 与数据拷贝","locale":"zh-cn"},"6226":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"7.5 Master 节点（TTL 检查器）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6227":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#76-执行流程","content":"7.6 执行流程","locale":"zh-cn"},"6228":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#八数据淘汰机制配额与-lru","content":"八、数据淘汰机制（配额与 LRU）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6229":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#81-工作原理","content":"8.1 工作原理","locale":"zh-cn"},"6230":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#82-配置示例","content":"8.2 配置示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"6231":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#83-与-ttl-的关联","content":"8.3 与 TTL 的关联","locale":"zh-cn"},"6232":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#九缓存方式","content":"九、缓存方式","locale":"zh-cn"},"6233":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"9.1 自动缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6234":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"9.2 主动缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6235":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"十、快速小结","locale":"zh-cn"},"6236":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","content":"对于初次接触的使用者来说，你可以把 Curvine 简单理解为：一个可以像本地磁盘一样使用的分布式文件缓存。它不用你关心数据存在集群的哪台机器、哪种存储上，只需通过一个挂载点，就能轻松使用分布式的缓存能力，适配绝大多数日常文件操作场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6237":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"Curvine 是一款分布式文件缓存系统，它能够把集群内的各类存储介质、远端存储资源整合在一起，构建出一个统一的文件目录空间，并且对外提供可直接挂载的文件系统。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6238":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"和传统分布式文件系统不同，Curvine 最大的亮点是完整兼容 POSIX 语义，使用体验和你电脑上的本地磁盘几乎没有区别。不用额外学习复杂的操作指令，也不用改造原有应用，不管是日常开发、数据缓存、`git clone`、数据库文件存储、日志写入还是临时文件存放，直接把文件路径指向 Curvine 挂载点即可，完全做到“即挂即用”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6239":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                                          |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 统一命名空间 | 只用一个挂载点，就能访问全部文件目录，不用关心数据具体存在哪台 Worker 节点、哪种存储介质上；文件路径、权限设置和本地文件系统完全一致，上手零成本。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6240":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力         | 通俗说明                                                                   |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 高速缓存，重复访问更流畅 | 常用的工作数据会驻留在集群内速度更快的介质中，反复访问这些数据时，能大幅减少对远端存储或低速存储的 I/O 请求，打开、读取文件的速度更快。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6241":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                                                                   |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 智能分层存储 | 支持内存（MEM）、固态硬盘（SSD）、机械硬盘（HDD）多种存储层级，管理员提前配置好各层级路径，使用者可以指定优先写入的介质；当优先层级空间不足时，数据会自动向下一层级溢出，平衡速度、成本和存储容量。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6242":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                           |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 智能空间管理 | 通过 TTL 时间过期和配额 + LRU 淘汰双重机制管控存储空间，避免缓存无限占用集群容量，不用手动清理也能保持空间充足。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6243":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力          | 通俗说明                                                                             |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 完整 POSIX 文件语义 | 全面支持各类标准文件操作，包括随机写、并发写、文件锁、扩展属性、软硬链接、稀疏文件等，能适配日志、数据库、项目构建等真实业务场景，原有本地应用直接迁移即可使用。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6244":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#三和本地磁盘一样的使用体验","content":"Curvine 完全贴合本地磁盘使用习惯。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6245":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#31-多进程并发写入","content":"多个客户端、多个进程可以同时写入同一个文件，不需要应用自己做协调管控，只要写入文件的不同偏移位置，就不会出现数据混乱，和本地多进程写文件的语义完全一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6246":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#32-自由随机写入","content":"不限制只能顺序写或追加写，支持在文件的任意位置随时写入数据，适配数据库、大文件修改等需要随机读写的场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6247":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#33-常用命令全兼容","content":"Linux 系统下所有常规文件操作命令，比如 `cp`（复制）、`mv`（移动）、`rm`（删除）、`mkdir`（新建文件夹）、`ls`（查看目录）、`find`（查找文件）等，在 Curvine 挂载点上都能正常使用，操作习惯完全不用改。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6248":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"Curvine 完整支持各类 POSIX 高级特性，满足各类复杂业务需求，具体能力说明如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6249":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称      | 详细说明                                                 |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 随机写 & 并发写 | 支持文件任意位置写入，多客户端可同时操作同一文件的不同区域，适配日志、数据库等对写入灵活性要求高的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6250":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称          | 详细说明                                           |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 扩展属性（`xattr`） | 完整支持文件扩展属性，使用者可以自定义存储文件的专属元数据，方便做文件标记、业务关联等操作。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6251":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称      | 详细说明                                                                    |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 符号链接（软链接） | 支持软链接功能，建议链接目标都指向 Curvine 内部路径；如果链接到本机其他目录或其他节点本地路径，分布式环境下其他节点可能无法正常访问。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6252":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称 | 详细说明                                                |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 硬链接  | 支持硬链接，语义和本地文件系统一致，仅适用于 Curvine 内部同一文件系统范围内，跨系统无法创建。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6253":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称 | 详细说明                                                                          |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 文件锁  | 兼容 POSIX 锁和 BSD 锁，考虑到分布式环境的稳定性，文件锁带有默认 5 分钟超时自动释放机制，避免客户端或节点异常导致锁一直占用，引发死锁问题。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6254":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称       | 详细说明                                       |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 稀疏文件（文件空洞） | 支持稀疏文件模式，没有实际写入数据的空洞区域不会占用物理存储空间，节省集群存储资源。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6255":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称  | 详细说明                                        |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 空间预分配 | 支持提前为文件分配存储空间，避免大文件写入过程中出现空间不足的问题，保证写入流程稳定。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6256":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称   | 详细说明                                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 常规文件属性 | 文件权限位、访问/修改时间戳、文件截断等基础 inode 语义，完全遵循 POSIX 标准，和本地文件操作体验一致。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6257":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#五分层存储使用说明","content":"Curvine 支持多层级存储介质，通过简单配置即可指定数据存储优先级，兼顾速度与成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6258":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#51-工作原理","content":"Worker 节点配置各存储层级的路径和标签，使用者在客户端指定优先使用的存储类型，数据会优先写入目标层级；当该层级容量不足时，会自动降级到下一层级存储，无需手动干预。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6259":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"Worker 节点配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6260":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"客户端配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6261":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"配置效果：新建文件优先存入内存层，内存空间不足时，自动依次存入 SSD、HDD 层。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6262":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"写入策略控制挂载路径上的数据写入方式，通过 `cv mount ... --write-type <类型>` 配置，CLI 默认值为 `fs_mode`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6263":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"| 策略        | CLI 取值       | 行为                                 | 适用场景            |\n| --------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| CacheMode | `cache_mode` | 直接写到底层 UFS，Curvine 主要承担统一访问与缓存读取层。 | 数据主存仍在 UFS 的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6264":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"| 策略     | CLI 取值    | 行为                                       | 适用场景                   |\n| ------ | --------- | ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| FsMode | `fs_mode` | 优先写入 Curvine 命名空间；首次挂载时可能触发元数据 `resync`。 | 由 Curvine 管理缓存命名空间的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6265":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"当前面向用户的读侧校验开关是挂载参数 `--read-verify-ufs`：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6266":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"| 策略  | 行为                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| 关闭  | 信任缓存与统一文件系统默认回退逻辑。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6267":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"| 策略  | 行为                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------- |\n| 开启  | 读前按 UFS 元数据（`mtime` 与文件长度）校验缓存。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6268":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"当校验失败或缓存未命中时，会直接从 UFS 读取；若该挂载启用了自动缓存，可同时异步将数据加载到 Curvine。`[transfer] enabled = true` 时，该任务由独立 Transfer 服务负责；否则仍使用旧 Master 任务路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6269":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#七数据过期管理ttl","content":"为了合理管控缓存空间，Curvine 支持为文件、目录配置过期时间和过期策略，自主控制数据生命周期。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6270":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#71-基础配置示例","content":"配置效果：文件从最后一次修改时间（`mtime`）开始计算，1 天后自动过期，执行删除操作。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6271":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"使用 `cv mount` 挂载 UFS 时，可为该挂载设置 TTL：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6272":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"| 选项         | 类型       | 默认值        | 说明       | 示例               |\n| ---------- | -------- | ---------- | -------- | ---------------- |\n| `--ttl-ms` | duration | `7d`（挂载默认） | 缓存数据过期时间 | `24h`、`7d`、`30d` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6273":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"挂载点的 TTL 动作由 `write_type` 推导：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6274":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"`cache_mode` 挂载默认对应 `delete`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6275":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"`fs_mode` 挂载默认对应 `free`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6276":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值   | 具体含义                            |\n| ------ | ------------------------------- |\n| `none` | 关闭时间过期功能，数据会一直保留，直到手动删除或其他策略清理。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6277":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值     | 具体含义                                         |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `delete` | 过期后彻底删除文件数据和元数据，是最常用的“到期清理”策略，时间从文件最后修改时间算起。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6278":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值   | 具体含义                                          |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `free` | 过期后只释放文件占用的数据块，保留目录和元数据，适合需要保留目录结构、清理缓存数据的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6279":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#74-使用注意mtime-与数据拷贝","content":"使用 `rclone` 等工具往 Curvine 拷贝文件时，工具会保留源文件的原始修改时间（`mtime`）。如果源文件本身已经存放很久，拷贝后可能会立刻触发 TTL 过期，导致文件被删除或释放。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6280":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#74-使用注意mtime-与数据拷贝","content":"建议大批量导入数据前，先确认 TTL 配置，或导入后手动调整文件 `mtime`、临时关闭 TTL，避免数据误清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6281":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"在集群配置的 `[master]` 段中，使用以下 TOML 键：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6282":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                     | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明          |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | ---- | ----------- |\n| `ttl_checker_interval` | duration | `1h` | TTL 检查器运行间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6283":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                           | 类型  | 默认值 | 说明               |\n| ---------------------------- | --- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `ttl_checker_retry_attempts` | u32 | `3` | TTL 操作失败时的最大重试次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6284":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                    | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明                  |\n| --------------------- | -------- | ---- | ------------------- |\n| `ttl_bucket_interval` | duration | `1h` | 批量处理过期 inode 的桶时间间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6285":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                       | 类型       | 默认值   | 说明               |\n| ------------------------ | -------- | ----- | ---------------- |\n| `ttl_max_retry_duration` | duration | `10m` | 失败 TTL 操作的最大重试时长 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6286":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                   | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明   |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ---- | ---- |\n| `ttl_retry_interval` | duration | `1s` | 重试间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6287":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#八数据淘汰机制配额与-lru","content":"除了按时间过期，Curvine 还支持基于存储配额的自动淘汰，防止集群存储空间被写满，保障系统稳定运行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6288":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#81-工作原理","content":"开启配额淘汰后，当集群存储用量达到设定的高水位线时，系统会自动按照 LRU（最近最少使用）规则，清理长时间没有访问过的数据，直到存储空间回落至安全范围。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6289":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#83-与-ttl-的关联","content":"如果设置 `ttl_action = \"none\"`，关闭了时间过期策略，那么数据也不会被配额 LRU 机制淘汰删除，适合需要长期保留的重要数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6290":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"当某挂载配置了非零 TTL（例如 `cv mount s3://bucket/prefix /path --ttl-ms 7d`）时，即启用该挂载的自动缓存。在该挂载下首次读取某个 UFS 文件（缓存未命中）时，Curvine 会提交一个异步加载任务，将数据拉取到 Curvine；本次读取由 UFS 直接返回，任务在后台执行。该任务与手工 `cv load` 使用相同的 Transfer 路由规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6291":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"在日志中可看到类似输出：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6292":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"客户端启用 Transfer 后，自动缓存会创建 Transfer Job。可使用 Job ID 查询状态：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6293":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"`load-status` 仍是兼容命令。未启用 Transfer 的客户端仍查询旧 Master Job 路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6294":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"先挂载 UFS，再通过它在 Curvine 中的路径主动加载：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6295":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"自动缓存与主动缓存可同时使用；主动缓存可缩短该文件首次读取的等待时间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6296":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"客户端启用 Transfer 后，同一个 `cv load` 会自动提交 Transfer Job。服务部署和客户端\n路由见 Transfer 服务。可使用\n`cv transfer list` 和 `cv transfer status <job_id>` 执行任务级运维。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6297":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"加载数据前，须先将 UFS 挂载到 Curvine（`cv mount`）。\n自动缓存与主动缓存均使用固定缓存路径，与 UFS 目录结构一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6298":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- |\n| 产品定位 | 分布式文件缓存，支持 POSIX 挂载，使用体验等同于本地磁盘 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6299":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                               |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 核心优势 | 统一命名空间、分层智能存储、TTL + LRU 双重空间管控、完整 POSIX 语义 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6300":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点             |\n| ---- | ------------------------ |\n| 写入能力 | 支持随机写、多客户端并发写同一文件，适配复杂业务 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6301":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                   |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ |\n| 高级特性 | 支持扩展属性、软硬链接、带超时的文件锁、稀疏文件、空间预分配 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6302":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点               |\n| ---- | -------------------------- |\n| 存储管理 | 多介质分层存储，客户端可指定优先级，空间不足自动降级 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6303":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                                 |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 空间管控 | 基于 `mtime` 的 TTL 过期 + 可选配额 LRU 自动淘汰，灵活管控存储容量 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6304":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"page","content":"Follower 元数据读取","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","locale":"zh-cn"},"6305":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#配置示例","content":"配置示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"6306":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"Master 参数","locale":"zh-cn"},"6307":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#客户端参数","content":"客户端参数","locale":"zh-cn"},"6308":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"Worker 参数","locale":"zh-cn"},"6309":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"启用顺序","locale":"zh-cn"},"6310":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#使用示例","content":"使用示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"6311":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#支持的读取与回退","content":"支持的读取与回退","locale":"zh-cn"},"6312":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"验证与排查","locale":"zh-cn"},"6313":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#关闭-follower-读取","content":"关闭 Follower 读取","locale":"zh-cn"},"6314":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","content":"Follower 元数据读取允许客户端将符合条件的元数据查询发送到已追上进度的 Follower Master，从而减轻 Leader 的读取负载。文件数据仍由 Worker 提供，元数据写入仍发送到 Leader。该功能默认关闭。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6315":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","content":"Master、Worker 和客户端都应使用包含 Curvine #1854 的构建版本。首先准备一个已运行的多 Master Raft 集群；集群成员和各节点地址的配置见部署环境设置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6316":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","content":"Follower 读取**不提供线性一致性**。即使设置 `follower_read_max_commit_lag = 0`，新鲜度检查也只依据该 Follower 最近收到的 Leader 提交进度证明，而不是响应发送时 Leader 的准确提交位置。如果业务要求每次读取都能看到最新已提交写入，请保持客户端 Follower 读取关闭。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6317":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#配置示例","content":"下面展示三 Master 集群的目标配置。将 `master-1`、`master-2`、`master-3` 替换为可解析的主机名，并将设置合并到现有 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml` 的相应配置节中。保留各节点自己的主机名、存储路径和其他部署设置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6318":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#配置示例","content":"在所有 Master 上应用 Master 设置，在所有 Worker 上应用 Worker 设置，并在每个 CLI、SDK 或 FUSE 客户端的实际配置中应用客户端设置。`8996` 是 Raft 端口，`8995` 是客户端访问 Master 的 RPC 端口。请按下文顺序逐步启用，不要同时开启所有角色的开关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6319":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"以下参数位于 `[master]` 配置节。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6320":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"| 参数                       | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `follower_reads_enabled` | `false` | 当新鲜度检查通过时，允许 Follower 处理符合条件的元数据读取。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6321":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"| 参数                              | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                                                       |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_worker_state_enabled` | `false` | 在 Follower 上维护被动 Worker 和副本状态。返回块位置的读取需要同时启用此设置和 Worker 报告镜像。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6322":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"| 参数                             | 默认值 | 含义及取值范围                                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_read_max_commit_lag` | `0` | 元数据应用进度相对于“本地 Raft 提交位置”和“最近证明的 Leader 提交位置”两者较大值所允许落后的最大日志条目数。范围为 `0`–`10000`；非零值明确允许返回更旧的元数据。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6323":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"| 参数                                  | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_read_apply_stall_timeout` | `\"30s\"` | 元数据应用或本地复制进度停止推进后，拒绝 Follower 读取的超时。两类停滞分别跟踪。范围为 `\"1ms\"`–`\"10m\"`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6324":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#master-参数","content":"Follower 还必须完成元数据重放，并且近期收到当前任期 Leader 的有效请求。如果 Leader 请求不包含提交进度证明，Follower 读取会保持不可用，直到后续有效请求提供证明。因此，混合版本升级期间的旧 Leader 可能导致客户端回退到 Leader 读取。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6325":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#客户端参数","content":"以下参数位于 `[client]` 配置节。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6326":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#客户端参数","content":"| 参数                       | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                               |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_reads_enabled` | `false` | 对支持的读取先尝试一个符合条件的 Follower，再使用 Leader。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6327":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#客户端参数","content":"| 参数                         | 默认值    | 含义及取值范围                                                      |\n| -------------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `follower_write_sticky_ms` | `5000` | 在同一个客户端上下文内，将与近期修改相关的读取保持在 Leader 上。开启 Follower 读取时必须大于 `0`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6328":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#客户端参数","content":"粘滞时间从修改 RPC 结束后开始计算，包括 RPC 失败或被取消的情况；修改进行期间，相关读取也保持在 Leader 上。匹配范围包括修改路径、后代路径和祖先目录列表。这是同一上下文内共享的有限时间提示，不是跨客户端的“写后读”一致性保证。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6329":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"以下参数位于 `[worker]` 配置节。当 `follower_reports_enabled = true` 时，会校验队列和重试限制。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6330":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                         | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                                 |\n| -------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_reports_enabled` | `false` | 向 Follower Master 镜像 Worker 生命周期心跳和块报告。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6331":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                              | 默认值   | 含义及取值范围                                   |\n| ------------------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_report_queue_max_ops` | `256` | 每个 Follower 队列最多保留的块报告操作数。范围为 `1`–`4096`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6332":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                                | 默认值                | 含义及取值范围                                                             |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_report_queue_max_bytes` | `67108864`（64 MiB） | 每个 Worker 的 Follower 队列和全量重同步清单共享的字节预算。范围为 `1`–`1073741824`（1 GiB）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6333":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                                | 默认值  | 含义及取值范围                                                               |\n| --------------------------------- | ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_report_max_peer_queues` | `32` | 每个 Worker 最多创建的 Follower 队列数。范围为 `1`–`32`，应覆盖需要副本状态的 Follower Master。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6334":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                                | 默认值  | 含义及取值范围                                                      |\n| --------------------------------- | ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `follower_report_max_concurrency` | `16` | 每个 Worker 同时执行的 Follower RPC 上限。范围为 `1`–`32`；每个对端内部的请求仍保持顺序。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6335":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                                 | 默认值     | 含义及取值范围                                      |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `follower_report_retry_timeout_ms` | `30000` | 单个排队的 Follower 请求的总重试预算。范围为 `1`–`300000` 毫秒。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6336":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                             | 默认值   | 含义及取值范围                        |\n| ------------------------------ | ----- | ------------------------------ |\n| `follower_report_retry_min_ms` | `100` | 初始重试间隔。必须为正数，且不超过总重试超时和最大重试间隔。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6337":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"| 参数                             | 默认值    | 含义及取值范围                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `follower_report_retry_max_ms` | `5000` | 最大重试间隔，也用于重同步退避。不得小于最小间隔，且不得超过 `60000` 毫秒。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6338":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"队列溢出、未纳入队列的对端或发送失败都会要求全量报告重同步。Worker 状态不完整的 Follower 会拒绝依赖块位置的读取，让客户端使用 Leader。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6339":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#worker-参数","content":"字节预算必须容纳 Worker 的全量块清单、排队消息以及各对端的额外开销。例如，每个块条目占用 48 字节时，64 MiB 在**尚未计入额外开销**前约能容纳 140 万条记录，实际容量取决于构建版本。如果完整清单无法放入预算，Follower 会保持未就绪，客户端持续回退。请根据 Worker 清单规模增大预算，但不要超过配置上限。清单收集在心跳任务之外执行，重同步失败后会退避重试。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6340":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"将 Master、Worker 和客户端升级到包含该功能的版本。升级期间保持 Follower 读取开关关闭。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6341":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"在所有 Master 上启用 `master.follower_reads_enabled` 和 `master.follower_worker_state_enabled`，按现有部署方式执行滚动重启。先将允许的提交落后条目数保持为 `0`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6342":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"启用 `worker.follower_reports_enabled` 并重启 Worker。等待 Start 心跳和完整的全量块报告到达每个候选 Follower。此时仍保持客户端 Follower 读取关闭。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6343":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"在应用、CLI 或 FUSE 配置中启用 `client.follower_reads_enabled` 并重启客户端。在扩大启用范围前，观察 Follower 读取成功和拒绝指标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6344":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#启用顺序","content":"块位置查询和只读文件打开需要 Worker 报告镜像。文件状态、目录列表等纯元数据操作无需完整副本状态，也可以使用已追上进度的 Follower。发生选举后，Follower 会使被动就绪状态失效，并要求新的报告，然后才能再次处理依赖块位置的读取。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6345":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#使用示例","content":"开启功能后，无需使用特殊的文件系统命令。将客户端设置保存到 `conf/curvine-follower.toml`，并保留原有配置的其他部分。以下示例假设 Curvine 原生命名空间中已存在完成复制的文件 `/datasets/example.txt`：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6346":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#使用示例","content":"文件状态和目录列表操作可以路由到 Follower。读取文件时，元数据和块位置可以来自已就绪的 Follower，文件字节仍从 Worker 读取。`--cache-only` 将目录查询限制在 Curvine 缓存命名空间内，不再同时查询已挂载的 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6347":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#使用示例","content":"即使使用相同的客户端配置，写入仍通过 Leader：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6348":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#使用示例","content":"每次 CLI 调用都会创建独立的客户端上下文。不同 CLI 命令不共享粘滞时间，因此不能用跨命令的“写入后立即读取”来证明写后读一致性。客户端自动选择 Follower；命令成功并不能单独证明由 Follower 提供了响应，请使用下面的指标验证路由。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6349":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#支持的读取与回退","content":"| 操作                                                                              | 路由行为                                            |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `Exists`、`FileStatus`、`ListStatus`、`ListOptions`、`GetMountTable`、`GetMountInfo` | 新鲜度检查通过时可使用 Follower；包含 glob 模式的目录列表仍通过 Leader。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6350":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#支持的读取与回退","content":"| 操作                                     | 路由行为                         |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `GetBlockLocations`、有效只读标志的 `OpenFile` | 还要求返回的每个块具有就绪且存活的 Worker 位置。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6351":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#支持的读取与回退","content":"| 操作                          | 路由行为        |\n| --------------------------- | ----------- |\n| 写入、可写文件打开、回收站操作、不支持或格式错误的请求 | 仅使用 Leader。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6352":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#支持的读取与回退","content":"客户端最多尝试一个 Follower。连接和请求的总耗时上限为“一秒”和“`client.rpc_timeout_ms` 剩余时间的一半”两者中的较小值。可重试的拒绝或传输错误会触发一次 Leader 路由回退，使用剩余超时预算。失败的对端进入五秒冷却期，该状态由客户端克隆共享。文件不存在、权限不足等终止性错误会直接返回，不会重试 Leader。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6353":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"采集各个 Follower 的指标。独立部署的 Master 默认指标端口为 `9010`：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6354":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"如果实际端口不同，请使用配置中的 `master.web_port`。指标采集方式见监控指标。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6355":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"`master_follower_read_accepted_total{rpc_code=...}` 统计 Follower 实际处理的读取。可以比较执行上述读取命令前后的计数。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6356":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"`master_follower_read_refused_total{rpc_code=...,reason=...}` 统计 Master 拒绝的读取，不包括客户端直接跳过 Follower 的决策。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6357":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"| 拒绝原因                            | 排查方向                                            |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `replay_not_ready`、`commit_lag` | 检查元数据重放和 Raft 复制进度。除非业务接受旧元数据，否则保持允许落后条目数为 `0`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6358":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"| 拒绝原因                                                                     | 排查方向                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `no_current_term_contact`、`stale_leader_contact`、`leader_commit_unknown` | 检查 Master 之间的连通性、选举状态，以及 Leader 是否支持提交进度证明。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6359":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"| 拒绝原因                                  | 排查方向                                |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `apply_stalled`、`replication_stalled` | 元数据应用或复制没有推进，检查 Master 日志以及存储、网络状态。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6360":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"| 拒绝原因                        | 排查方向                                             |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `block_locations_not_ready` | 检查 Worker 镜像、当前 Worker 会话、全量报告是否完成、队列限制及重同步清单预算。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6361":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#验证与排查","content":"正常回退仍可返回成功的业务结果，因此应检查实际处理计数，而不能仅根据命令是否成功判断。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6362":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/follower-reads#关闭-follower-读取","content":"首先设置 `client.follower_reads_enabled = false` 并重启客户端，恢复 Leader 路由。如不再需要，再关闭 Worker 镜像和两个 Master 开关，并按现有重启流程应用各角色的配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6363":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"page","content":"FUSE","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","locale":"zh-cn"},"6364":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#一fuse-基础认知","content":"一、FUSE 基础认知","locale":"zh-cn"},"6365":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-什么是-fuse","content":"1. 什么是 FUSE？","locale":"zh-cn"},"6366":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"2. FUSE 对 Curvine 的核心作用","locale":"zh-cn"},"6367":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#二数据一致性","content":"二、数据一致性","locale":"zh-cn"},"6368":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-常规分布式存储close-to-open-语义","content":"1. 常规分布式存储：Close-to-Open 语义","locale":"zh-cn"},"6369":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"2. Curvine 一致性：Flush 即可见","locale":"zh-cn"},"6370":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"3. 并发读写注意事项","locale":"zh-cn"},"6371":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#三元数据缓存","content":"三、元数据缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6372":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"1. 内核元数据缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6373":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"2. 客户端元数据缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6374":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"3. 两种缓存对比与使用建议","locale":"zh-cn"},"6375":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#四数据缓存","content":"四、数据缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6376":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"1. 内核页缓存（Page Cache）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6377":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"2. 内核回写模式（Writeback Cache）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6378":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#五fuse-版本选择","content":"五、FUSE 版本选择","locale":"zh-cn"},"6379":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-什么是-fuse","content":"FUSE 全称 Filesystem in Userspace，即用户态文件系统，是 Linux 内核提供的通用机制，最大优势是把分布式/自定义存储，变成和本地磁盘一样的操作体验。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6380":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"FUSE 是 Curvine 最主要、最通用的 API 入口，也是接入最简单的方式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6381":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"零改造使用：用户无需修改业务代码、不用额外适配，像操作本地 C 盘、D 盘一样，通过系统自带的文件命令（`ls`、`cat`、`vim`、`git` 等）操作 Curvine 存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"6382":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-fuse-对-curvine-的核心作用","content":"高性能根基：Curvine 基于 Rust 语言，对 FUSE 做了完全异步重构，且仅依赖内核原生 FUSE 模块，没有额外冗余依赖，这是它支持高并发、高性能的核心底层保障","locale":"zh-cn"},"6383":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-常规分布式存储close-to-open-语义","content":"大部分分布式存储默认遵循 Close-to-Open：文件写入后，必须执行 close 关闭操作，写入的数据才会对其他客户端可见，中途写入的内容不会暴露。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6384":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"Curvine 不遵循 Close-to-Open，而是和本地磁盘文件语义完全一致：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6385":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"核心规则：数据只要执行 flush（刷新到存储），就立刻对所有客户端可见，无需等待 close 关闭文件","locale":"zh-cn"},"6386":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-curvine-一致性flush-即可见","content":"核心价值：这是 Curvine 能支持 `git clone`、数据库存储等复杂应用场景的关键，这类场景需要和本地磁盘完全一致的文件语义","locale":"zh-cn"},"6387":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"Curvine 支持多客户端并发读写同一个文件，但有明确特性：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6388":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"为了完整支持 POSIX 语义，Curvine 移除了写保护","locale":"zh-cn"},"6389":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"风险点：无写保护情况下，多客户端同时写入同一文件，可能出现数据覆盖、读到脏数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6390":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-并发读写注意事项","content":"一句话总结差异：Curvine 一致性 = 本地磁盘语义，牺牲部分写保护，换并发、随机写能力；其他分布式存储 = 写保护 + Close-to-Open，牺牲可见性，换强一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6391":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#三元数据缓存","content":"元数据：简单理解就是文件的“身份信息”，比如文件名、大小、权限、修改时间、文件/目录类型等，缓存元数据能大幅提升文件查询性能，Curvine 分为内核元数据缓存和客户端元数据缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6392":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"Curvine 的 FUSE 客户端，可通过配置控制内核层面的元数据缓存，默认缓存 1 秒，显著提升查询效率。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6393":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"核心配置参数：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6394":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项            | 默认值 | 作用                              |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `attr_timeout` | 1 秒 | 文件属性缓存时间，加速 `getattr`（查询文件属性）操作 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6395":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项             | 默认值 | 作用                                |\n| --------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| `entry_timeout` | 1 秒 | 文件/目录类型缓存时间，加速 `lookup`（查找文件路径）操作 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6396":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"| 配置项                | 默认值     | 作用                      |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `negative_timeout` | 0 秒（禁用） | 不存在文件的查询失败缓存时间，避免重复无效请求 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6397":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"缓存意义：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6398":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"访问路径如 `/a/b/c.log`，内核会依次查找 `/`、`/a`、`/a/b`、`/a/b/c.log`，无缓存需发起 4 次以上远程 RPC 请求；有缓存后直接从内核取数据，大量小文件场景下，性能提升极其明显，文件数据变化不频繁时，可适当调大缓存时间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6399":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"核心特点：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6400":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"减少内核与用户态的切换，缓存命中时不访问 Curvine 用户态程序","locale":"zh-cn"},"6401":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核元数据缓存","content":"仅能加速 `lookup`、`getattr` 等少数接口，缓存内容有限","locale":"zh-cn"},"6402":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"Curvine 自身开发的客户端级缓存，缓存内容比内核缓存更全面：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6403":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"缓存完整文件属性、文件 block 块信息、目录下所有文件列表","locale":"zh-cn"},"6404":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"优势：重复打开同一文件，无需访问元数据服务，大幅减少 RPC 远程调用","locale":"zh-cn"},"6405":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-客户端元数据缓存","content":"局限性：仅保证单客户端内数据一致。当前客户端新建文件，自身可立刻看到；其他客户端新建文件，需等本客户端缓存过期才能看到","locale":"zh-cn"},"6406":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"内核缓存：减少内核态切换，仅加速部分接口，全页缓存命中场景性能最优","locale":"zh-cn"},"6407":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"客户端缓存：缓存内容全，减少 RPC，但无法减少态切换","locale":"zh-cn"},"6408":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#3-两种缓存对比与使用建议","content":"使用方式：可单独用一种，也可搭配使用，根据业务场景灵活调整","locale":"zh-cn"},"6409":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"原理：内核会把已经读过的文件数据，缓存到内存页缓存中，重复读取时直接从内存取","locale":"zh-cn"},"6410":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"Curvine 优化：会跟踪已打开文件，文件被修改则页缓存自动失效，保证读到最新数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6411":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"性能表现：重复读同一文件，延时低至微秒，吞吐量可达每秒几十 GiB，速度极快","locale":"zh-cn"},"6412":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#1-内核页缓存page-cache","content":"默认开启，内存不足时可配置 `direct_io = true` 关闭页缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6413":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"内核要求：Linux 内核 3.15 及以上支持，FUSE 专属特性","locale":"zh-cn"},"6414":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"原理：内核把大量小体积、高频随机写请求合并后再批量写入，减少 IO 次数，提升随机写性能","locale":"zh-cn"},"6415":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"副作用：会把顺序写转为随机写，严重降低顺序写入性能","locale":"zh-cn"},"6416":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#2-内核回写模式writeback-cache","content":"默认关闭，需手动配置开启，仅适合随机写多的场景，顺序写场景不建议开启","locale":"zh-cn"},"6417":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#五fuse-版本选择","content":"推荐配置：Linux 内核版本 5.0 及以上，比如 Ubuntu 22.04、Rocky Linux 9 等，能发挥 FUSE 最佳性能，异步、缓存特性完全适配","locale":"zh-cn"},"6418":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse#五fuse-版本选择","content":"低内核风险：内核版本低于 4.15，FUSE 并发能力差、性能瓶颈明显，不建议生产环境使用","locale":"zh-cn"},"6419":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","type":"page","content":"Key Features","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features","locale":"zh-cn"},"6420":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"page","content":"统一命名空间","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","locale":"zh-cn"},"6421":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"一、UFS 挂载","locale":"zh-cn"},"6422":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载","content":"二、挂载命令","locale":"zh-cn"},"6423":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"2.1 本地目录挂载（测试）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6424":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"2.2 外部存储挂载","locale":"zh-cn"},"6425":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"2.3 完整 Mount 命令参数表","locale":"zh-cn"},"6426":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"三、查看已有挂载点","locale":"zh-cn"},"6427":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载模式","content":"四、两种挂载模式详解","locale":"zh-cn"},"6428":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"4.1 cache_mode（高性能读缓存）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6429":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"4.2 fs_mode（分层文件系统）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6430":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"五、统一访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6431":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"六、空间释放","locale":"zh-cn"},"6432":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#七关闭统一访问","content":"七、关闭统一访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6433":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"八、总结","locale":"zh-cn"},"6434":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","content":"Curvine 提供 UFS（统一文件系统）视图来管理所有支持的分布式存储系统，包括本地文件系统、S3/MinIO、HDFS 等。简单来说，Curvine 的 UFS 挂载，就是做一个“路径映射”，帮你把各种五花八门的外部存储，统一整合到 Curvine 自己的文件系统里，不用再分别记不同存储的访问方式，实现一套接口访问所有存储。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6435":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"两个核心路径概念：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6436":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"UFS 路径：外部原始存储地址，必须带专属前缀（scheme），相当于存储的“原生家门牌号”。常见格式包括本地目录 `file://fs/cache_mode`、对象存储 S3/MinIO `s3://bucket/prefix`、大数据存储 HDFS `hdfs://nn/path`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6437":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"Curvine 路径（CV 路径）：集群内部统一的逻辑路径，固定以 `/` 开头，属于 Curvine 专属的 `cv://` 命名空间，在客户端里就是你能直接访问的挂载点目录，相当于给外部存储起了一个“集群内部通用小名”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6438":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"挂载的核心价值：挂载完成后，不管底层是本地硬盘、S3 对象存储还是 HDFS，你都只用 Curvine 一套命令操作，完全不用关心底层存储的类型差异，大幅简化多存储访问成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6439":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"Curvine 将挂载表持久化到元数据中，因此 Curvine 重启时无需重新挂载。但必须遵循一些规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6440":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"不允许挂载到根路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6441":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"挂载路径下不允许挂载其他 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6442":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#一ufs-挂载","content":"相同的 Curvine 挂载路径不能挂载到不同的 UFS。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6443":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#挂载","content":"所有挂载命令都在 Curvine 安装目录下执行，基础命令格式固定：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6444":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"适合本地测试、快速体验统一命名空间，不用连接外部存储，零配置上手。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6445":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#21-本地目录挂载测试","content":"命令解释：把本地 `file://fs/cache_mode` 目录挂载到 Curvine 内部 `/fs/cache_mode` 路径，读写模式选用缓存模式（`cache_mode`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6446":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"对接 S3、OSS 这类对象存储时，需要额外配置连接地址、账号密码、地域等参数，替换成自己的存储信息即可使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6447":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"参数说明（新手必填项）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6448":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.endpoint_url`：S3/MinIO 服务的访问地址","locale":"zh-cn"},"6449":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.credentials.access` / `s3.credentials.secret`：存储的访问密钥（账号密码）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6450":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"`s3.region_name`：存储所属地域，无特殊需求填 `cn` 即可","locale":"zh-cn"},"6451":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#22-外部存储挂载","content":"对于 `s3://...` 挂载，CLI 会自动从 URI 提取 `s3.bucket_name`；对于 `hdfs://...` 挂载，CLI 会自动推导 `hdfs.namenode` 与 `hdfs.root`。如果出现 Kerberos 配置但缺少 `hdfs.kerberos.ccache` 或 `KRB5CCNAME`，CLI 会给出警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6452":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值 | 含义                                                                |\n| ---------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ufs_path` | 无   | 外部底层存储 URI 路径，必须带 scheme 前缀（`s3://`、`oss://`、`file://`），无前缀命令执行失败 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6453":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称      | 默认值 | 含义                                          |\n| --------- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv_path` | 无   | Curvine 内部逻辑挂载路径，必须以 `/` 开头，仅支持绝对路径，不支持相对路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6454":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称           | 默认值       | 含义                                                            |\n| -------------- | --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--write-type` | `fs_mode` | 挂载写入模式，必填核心参数，仅支持 `cache_mode`（缓存加速模式）、`fs_mode`（完整 POSIX 模式） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6455":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值     | 含义                                                                        |\n| ---------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--update` | `false` | 开关型 flag 参数，挂载点已存在时用于更新配置，挂载路径（`ufs_path` + `cv_path`）不可修改，未传该参数重复挂载会直接报错 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6456":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                   | 默认值    | 含义                                                                 |\n| ---------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--check-path-consist` | `true` | 布尔值，新建挂载时校验 UFS 路径与 CV 路径 path 部分一致，方便运维对应；设为 `false` 可允许两者路径形状不一致 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6457":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                | 默认值     | 含义                                                                                          |\n| ------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--read-verify-ufs` | `false` | 布尔值，仅 `cache_mode` 生效，设为 `true` 时，读取缓存前比对 UFS 文件 `mtime`（修改时间）和文件大小，不一致则判定缓存失效，重新从 UFS 读取数据 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6458":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称       | 默认值  | 含义                                                                             |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--ttl-ms` | `7d` | 挂载点数据缓存过期时间，支持人性化时间单位：`7d`（7 天）、`1h`（1 小时）、`30m`（30 分钟）、`100s`（100 秒），无需手动换算毫秒 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6459":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称         | 默认值 | 含义                                   |\n| ------------ | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replicas` | 无   | 整数类型，文件副本数配置，未设置时，创建文件自动回退至客户端默认副本配置 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6460":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称           | 默认值 | 含义                                 |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `--block-size` | 无   | 文件数据块大小配置，未设置时，创建文件自动回退至客户端默认块大小配置 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6461":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称                      | 默认值 | 含义                                                    |\n| ------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--storage-type`（简写 `-s`） | 无   | Curvine 本地存储介质类型，可选 `mem`（内存）、`ssd`（固态硬盘）、`hdd`（机械硬盘） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6462":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"| 参数名称         | 默认值                 | 含义                                                                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--provider` | 未设置（底层默认 `opendal`） | UFS 底层实现方式选择，可选 `auto`（自动识别）、`oss-hdfs`、`opendal`，默认 `opendal` 适配绝大多数存储类型 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6463":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#23-完整-mount-命令参数表","content":"完整可复制挂载命令模板：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6464":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"挂载完成后，想查看集群里所有已配置的挂载点，不用记复杂参数，直接执行极简命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6465":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"示例输出：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6466":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`ID`：挂载点唯一标识，系统自动生成","locale":"zh-cn"},"6467":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`Curvine Path` / `UFS Path`：对应内部、外部路径，核对是否和自己配置一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6468":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`Write Type`：核心读写模式（`cache_mode` / `fs_mode`）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6469":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#三查看已有挂载点","content":"`TTL Action`：缓存过期处理策略","locale":"zh-cn"},"6470":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"核心定位：给外部存储做缓存加速，目录结构和原始数据以外部 UFS 存储为准，Curvine 只做缓存层，提升读取速度。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6471":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"核心运行逻辑：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6472":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"目录查询（list）、修改操作：直接查外部 UFS，保证视图最新","locale":"zh-cn"},"6473":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"文件属性查询（getattr）：先查 Curvine 缓存，缓存有效直接返回，无效再回查 UFS","locale":"zh-cn"},"6474":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"固定过期策略：`ttl_action=delete`，缓存到期后，Curvine 里的文件和目录会自动彻底删除，只保留外部 UFS 数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6475":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"读操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6476":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存未命中：直接读外部 UFS，同时异步后台把数据加载到 Curvine 缓存，下次读取直接走缓存，速度更快","locale":"zh-cn"},"6477":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存已命中：直接读 Curvine 缓存，不用访问 UFS","locale":"zh-cn"},"6478":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"风险提示：缓存有效期内，若外部 UFS 数据被其他工具修改，Curvine 缓存不会自动更新，会读到过期数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6479":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"解决办法：数据更新频繁的场景，挂载时加参数 `--read-verify-ufs=true`，每次读取前比对 UFS 文件修改时间和大小，不一致就重新拉取，代价是多一次 UFS 查询，读取速度稍慢","locale":"zh-cn"},"6480":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"写操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6481":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"写操作直接穿透到外部 UFS，Curvine 缓存同步失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6482":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"删除文件会直接删除 UFS 里的原始数据，不是只删缓存，操作需谨慎","locale":"zh-cn"},"6483":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"能力边界与限制：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6484":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"POSIX 文件语义完全依赖外部 UFS 支持，UFS 不支持的操作（比如软链接、文件锁）会直接报错","locale":"zh-cn"},"6485":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"部分高级操作（修改文件属性、软链接、文件锁）受限，以当前版本和 UFS 能力为准","locale":"zh-cn"},"6486":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存失效条件：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6487":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"缓存达到 TTL 过期时间，自动失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6488":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"通过 Curvine 执行写入、修改、删除操作，缓存主动失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6489":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#41-cache_mode高性能读缓存","content":"开启 `--read-verify-ufs` 后，UFS 文件修改时间/大小和 Curvine 记录不一致，缓存失效","locale":"zh-cn"},"6490":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心定位：脱离 UFS 语义限制，提供完整的 POSIX 文件系统能力，所有操作先在 Curvine 内部完成，再异步同步到外部 UFS，适合需要标准文件操作的业务场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6491":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心运行逻辑：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6492":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"所有数据操作先经过 Curvine，不走客户端直写 UFS，和未挂载外部存储的普通 Curvine 目录用法完全一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6493":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"操作日志通过 Raft 协议同步到所有 Master 节点，由 Leader 节点统一回放，同步到外部 UFS，保证 Curvine 和 UFS 数据最终一致","locale":"zh-cn"},"6494":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"核心操作与 UFS 同步规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6495":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型          | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                 |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 创建目录（`mkdir`） | Leader Master 自动访问 UFS，创建对应目录 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6496":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型              | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                 |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 删除文件/目录（`delete`） | Leader Master 自动删除 UFS 对应路径数据 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6497":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型               | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                  |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| 文件写入完成（`complete`） | 启动数据同步任务，把 Curvine 里的文件拷贝到 UFS |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6498":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"| 操作类型          | 同步到 UFS 的具体行为                                          |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 重命名（`rename`） | UFS 支持 rename：直接执行；UFS 不支持（如 S3/OSS）：删除源路径，全量拷贝数据到目标路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6499":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"S3、OSS 这类对象存储不支持 rename 操作，严禁对大目录执行 rename！会触发全量数据拷贝，耗时极长、阻塞后续操作，还会产生大量存储和带宽成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6500":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"元数据同步：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6501":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"`fs_mode` 下，Curvine 不会自动感知外部 UFS 的数据变化，如果直接在 S3/HDFS 后台修改、新增、删除文件，Curvine 目录不会更新。需要手动执行元数据对齐命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6502":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"替换路径为自己的 Curvine 挂载路径即可，生产环境建议定期执行或变更后手动执行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6503":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"数据过期规则：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6504":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"数据过期后：只清理 Curvine 里的实际数据，元数据保留，外部 UFS 数据不受影响","locale":"zh-cn"},"6505":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"再次读取：自动从 UFS 把数据加载回 Curvine，正常访问","locale":"zh-cn"},"6506":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#42-fs_mode分层文件系统","content":"过期后写入：核心原因是绝大多数 UFS（尤其是 S3、OSS、对象存储类）不支持随机写、文件空洞、增量修改等标准 POSIX 文件特性，无法直接在 UFS 底层完成写入操作，因此系统会先自动把 UFS 里的原始数据完整拷贝回 Curvine，再基于 Curvine 完成写入修改，大文件拷贝会产生一定耗时，属于正常机制，并非系统异常","locale":"zh-cn"},"6507":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"UFS 挂载后，Curvine 提供了一个统一的文件系统视图，客户端、命令行工具、FUSE、API 都可以通过统一的 Curvine 路径访问 UFS 文件系统。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6508":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#五统一访问","content":"如果使用 `cv` 命令，可以通过 `--cache-only` 临时关闭统一访问，只查看已缓存在 Curvine 中的文件。详见 CLI 页面。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6509":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"`cache_mode` 下删除文件会直接删 UFS 原始数据，如果你只想释放 Curvine 本地缓存空间、保留 UFS 原始数据和元数据，用 `free` 命令，绝对安全，不会误删不符合条件的数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6510":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"`-r`：递归清理目录下所有符合条件的缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6511":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"适用范围：`fs_mode`、`cache_mode`、未挂载 UFS 的普通目录都能用","locale":"zh-cn"},"6512":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"安全保障：不符合清理条件的文件自动跳过（比如无 TTL、未同步到 UFS 的数据）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6513":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#六空间释放","content":"清理条件：文件同时存在于 Curvine 和 UFS，且 `ttl_action != none`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6514":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#七关闭统一访问","content":"如果您不想使用统一访问，可以添加、修改如下配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6515":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"先明确场景：读多选 `cache_mode`，写多选 `fs_mode`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6516":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"挂载命令严格遵循：UFS 路径（带 scheme） + Curvine 路径（`/` 开头）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6517":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"`cache_mode` 删文件直接删 UFS，谨慎操作；`fs_mode` 别给 S3 大目录 rename","locale":"zh-cn"},"6518":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"外部 UFS 数据变更后，`fs_mode` 必须手动 `resync` 同步元数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6519":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/ufs#八总结","content":"释放缓存用 `free` 命令，安全不删原始数据","locale":"zh-cn"},"6520":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manua