\n| `--master-addrs <ADDRS>` | 直接覆盖客户端配置里的 Master 地址列表，例如 `m1:8995,m2:8995`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6558":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境通常直接使用 `cv`，因为集群配置已安装，或已通过 `CURVINE_CONF_FILE` 选择。仅在迁移或诊断时使用 `--conf` 指向非默认配置。`cv mount --config key=value` 仍表示 UFS 配置项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6559":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"**约定：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"6560":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境将发行包的 `bin/` 加入 `PATH` 后，直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6561":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"通过 `cargo run -p curvine-cli -- ...` 运行时，帮助中的程序名会显示为 `curvine-cli`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6562":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"本文中的 `<PATH>`、`<JOB_ID>` 等为位置参数；`[OPTION]` 表示可选项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6563":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"**用法：** `cv report [json|all|capacity|used|available]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6564":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令          | 说明                                                 |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv report` | 默认概览，包含 active master、容量、inode/block 数和 worker 列表。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6565":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令               | 说明                        |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `cv report json` | 以 JSON 输出完整 `MasterInfo`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6566":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令                                   | 说明                  |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| `cv report all --show-workers false` | 文本概览，可关闭 worker 明细。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6567":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令                                    | 说明                         |\n| ------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `cv report capacity [WORKER_ADDRESS]` | 查看集群容量，或查看单个 worker 的容量详情。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6568":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令               | 说明                      |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `cv report used` | 输出每个 live worker 的已用容量。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6569":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-48","page_id":"/zh-c