s/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"| 选项                              | 说明                    |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `--add-decommission <NODES>...` | 将一个或多个 worker 加入退役列表。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6576":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"| 选项                                 | 说明                     |\n| ---------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--remove-decommission <NODES>...` | 将一个或多个 worker 从退役列表移除。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6577":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"`<NODES>` 支持两种形式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6578":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"多个空格分隔参数：`host1:8997 host2:8997`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6579":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"单个逗号分隔参数：`host1:8997,host2:8997`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6580":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6581":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"`cv node --versions` 打印在线 worker 的版本分布，优先使用心跳上报的结构化\n`component_info.release_version`，回退到旧的 `software_version` 字符串：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6582":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"这些版本的含义以及 master 如何评估混合版本 peer，请参阅版本管理与兼容性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6583":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#2-node管理-worker-节点","content":"当前实现会在退役 API 调用前把 `hostname:port` 截断为 `hostname`。也就是说，端口主要用于人类可读和输入格式统一。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6584":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"**用法：** `cv fs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6585":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"`fs` 自身额外支持一个全局开关：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6586":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 选项             | 说明                                   |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--cache-only` | 仅查询 / 操作 Curvine 已缓存的数据，关闭统一 UFS 视图。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6587":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"当前源码里 `fs` 支持的子命令如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6588":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                | 说明            |\n| ----------------- | ------------- |\n| `cv fs ls [PATH]` | 列目录，默认路径 `/`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6589":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                   | 说明    |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| `cv fs mkdir <PATH> [-p\\|--parents]` | 创建目录。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6590":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                                        | 说明                              |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs put <LOCAL_PATH> <REMOTE_PATH> [-n\\|--no-clobber]` | 上传本地文件到 Curvine；`-n` 不覆盖已存在的目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6591":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                              | 说明                |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `cv fs get <PATH> <LOCAL_PATH>` | 下载 Curvine 文件到本地。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6592":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                           | 说明              |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `cv fs cat <PATH> [--offset N] [--length N]` | 输出文件内容，可指定字节范围。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6593":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                  | 说明                 |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `cv fs tail <PATH> [-n\\|--bytes N]` | 输出文件末尾的字节，默认 1024。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6594":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                   | 说明           |\n| -------------------- | ------------ |\n| `cv fs touch <PATH>` | 创建空文件或更新时间戳。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6595":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                                                         | 说明                                                                                                   |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs rm <PATH> [-r\\|--recursive] [--skip-trash] [--async] [-f\\|--force]` | 删除文件或目录。`--skip-trash` 绕过回收站（如已启用）直接永久删除；`--async` 立即返回，由 Master 在后台回收（仅限 Curvine 路径）；`-f` 忽略不存在的路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6596":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令               | 说明         |\n| ---------------- | ---------- |\n| `cv fs trash ls` | 列出回收站中的条目。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6597":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-76","pa