ct | Gauge | `worker_id`、`verdict` | 每个 worker 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6797":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"| 指标名称                  | 类型    | 标签                      | 描述                    |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| compat_client_verdict | Gauge | `client_addr`、`verdict` | 每个 client 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6798":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"| 指标名称                          | 类型      | 标签                    | 描述                |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| compat_enforce_rejected_total | Counter | `component`、`verdict` | enforce 模式下累计拒绝次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6799":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"`verdict` 标签取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、\n`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。建议对\n`compat_worker_verdict` / `compat_client_verdict` 中非 `compatible` 的结论设置告警，\n以发现混合版本集群；对 `compat_enforce_rejected_total` 的增长设置告警，\n及早发现升级冲突。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6800":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#journal-node-指标","content":"| 指标名称              | 描述           |\n| ----------------- | ------------ |\n| journal_queue_len | Journal 队列长度 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"tab