------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Metadata RocksDB (Inode engine) | Persistently stores the complete detailed information of all files and directories, including file size, permissions, modification time, data block locations, and complete directory association relationships. | It undertakes the persistent storage requirements of massive metadata. Through column families, different types of metadata are classified and stored, such as separating file attributes and directory relationships, improving read/write efficiency and management convenience while adapting to high-frequency metadata modification scenarios. |"],[220,"| Layer                    | Core Responsibility                                                                                                                                                                                                           | Design Motivation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------