iness reads/writes. It also facilitates log synchronization, compression, cleanup, and fault recovery, reducing performance loss. |"],[3270,"| Master | Client         | Protocol | Default Behavior                                     |\n| ------ | -------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x (legacy) | n/a      | ⚠️ Warning in `diagnose`; rejected only in `enforce` |"],[6875,"| Master | Client    | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | --------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x（旧版） | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |"],[3269,"| Master | Client | Protocol | Default Behavior |\n| ------ | ------ | -------- | ---------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.4.x  | 1        | ✅ Compatible     |"],[6874,"| Master | Client | 协议  | 默认行为 |\n| ------ | ------ | --- | ---- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.4.x  | 1   | ✅ 兼容 |"],[3267,"| Master | Worker                              | Protocol | Default Behavior                                     |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x (legacy, no `component_info`) | n/a      | ⚠️ Warning in `diagnose`; rejected only in `enforce` |"],[6872,"| Master | Worker                       | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | ---------------------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 0.3.x（旧版，无 `component_info`） | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |"],[6873,"| Master | Worker                  | 协议  | 默认行为                              |\n| ------ | ----------------------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | 低于 `min_worker_version` | 无   | ⚠️ `diagnose` 下告警；仅 `enforce` 下拒绝 |"],[3268,"| Master | Worker                 | Protocol | Default Behavior                                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 0.4.x  | < `mi